    {
      "id": "zh-u01-l03",
      "titulo": "Tone changes",
      "explicacao": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Some syllables change tone depending on the syllable that follows. The dictionary form stays the same, but you say it differently."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabela",
          "cabecalho": [
            "Rule",
            "Written",
            "Said"
          ],
          "linhas": [
            [
              "3rd + 3rd: the first becomes 2nd",
              "你好 nǐ hǎo",
              "ní hǎo"
            ],
            [
              "不 before a 4th tone becomes 2nd",
              "不是 bù shì",
              "bú shì"
            ],
            [
              "一 before a 4th tone becomes 2nd",
              "一个 yī gè",
              "yí gè"
            ],
            [
              "一 before a 1st, 2nd or 3rd tone becomes 4th",
              "一起 yī qǐ",
              "yì qǐ"
            ],
            [
              "一 alone, when counting or at the end stays 1st",
              "第一 dì yī",
              "dì yī"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "dica",
          "texto": "In this app, words with 一 and 不 show the tone you actually say, as most textbooks do: 一起 yì qǐ, 不客气 bú kè qi. The 3rd tone change is not marked: 你好 stays nǐ hǎo."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The neutral tone is short and light. It shows up in the second syllable of many common words: 爸爸 bà ba, 朋友 péng you, 谢谢 xiè xie."
        }
      ],
      "exemplos": [
        {
          "frase": "你好",
          "pinyin": "nǐ hǎo",
          "en": "hello",
          "pt": "olá"
        },
        {
          "frase": "不是",
          "pinyin": "bú shì",
          "en": "is not; no",
          "pt": "não é; não"
        },
        {
          "frase": "一起",
          "pinyin": "yì qǐ",
          "en": "together",
          "pt": "juntos"
        },
        {
          "frase": "一个人",
          "pinyin": "yí gè rén",
          "en": "one person; alone",
          "pt": "uma pessoa; sozinho"
        },
        {
          "frase": "很好",
          "pinyin": "hěn hǎo",
          "en": "very good",
          "pt": "muito bom"
        }
      ],
      "palavras": [
